[{"client_msg_id":"48457135-5b28-41e6-a55a-12d43b253ade","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"山本先生の3/7法とかやらされると、たぶんそのままダンベルで山本先生撲殺する自信ある","ts":"1620658662.343700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kiken","count":1,"users":["U03C6TEAZ"]},{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3QWY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8914e498-eba2-4340-902c-e84e8f1d6f7c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"キープ系はだいたいつらいですね。気力との勝負。プッシュアップキープとかもあと5cmおろしてはやく楽になりたいと常に思う","ts":"1620658481.342900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lQX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92f26275-31aa-4cfd-9ea4-b73068d5b1d3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"アウトプットはあります。敵にダメージを与えられる","ts":"1620658042.341400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dNkF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffdb02c9-96ce-4cf4-b10c-f79c251a72a8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"足あげはつらいですよね。アウトプットがないので「俺なんのために足あげてんだ」ってなる。","ts":"1620657984.341000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"utvZQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69570d10-00f0-4278-a3cc-e5f9a15e51a7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"単に食べすぎと言う説もある","ts":"1620657969.340900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2MtKK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d3f0a40-9348-48d0-bb1a-08a49e428435","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"リングフィットは結構キツいですね。しかし私の体がだらしなさすぎるのか、キツいといいつつ実際は全然負荷が行ってないのか、いまいち効果が出ない…それでも続けてるけど…","ts":"1620657948.340600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sKL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c50820ef-b6b4-44bf-8d9a-6581d1c1f575","type":"message","user":"UK0JC4CM8","text":"レッグレイズとかやってるとｼﾃ･･･ｺﾛｼﾃ･･･状態になります\n自分が腹筋全然無いのもありますけど・・・","ts":"1620657808.339500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BvLvO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1de4911-4aa0-44a1-913b-0255f0f1d5aa","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"リングフィットも見てるとつらそうですよね。","ts":"1620657718.339000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ofg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca6aa124-6f55-41d8-84be-3bd9401bcf1b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"結局のところ、運動ってキッツーってのをどんだけ持続するかの方法が違うだけなので、どの方法もキッツーまでやらないと効果が出にくい。","ts":"1620657546.338900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hU7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"668fe6ad-3138-480d-b14f-81e7303f5084","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"マジか…こわ…","ts":"1620657368.338800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xxh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f22a2765-82fa-4fa1-8bdd-0bd32f0fca53","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ビリーtheBoot Camp はやりすぎて亡くなった方いますからほどほどですね。","ts":"1620657314.338600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"INGG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54459870-b2ec-4416-a812-408cc350b8ea","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"バービージャンプと言うのがあるのか (なんもしらない)","ts":"1620657275.338500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z1DP8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7932707-5f37-4877-b2bd-540c481d37a2","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"バービーとかつらい","ts":"1620657274.338400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"snY0i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59a45514-3a67-4c36-ba67-41992699499a","type":"message","us