んじゃないすかね。","ts":"1620657071.334800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yee8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5824a225-c5f3-4997-bf5e-21209b2af7d7","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"けど段階選べるってことは毎回フィットする重さにするわけだからずっときついという・・・","ts":"1620657052.334400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AnDBM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b308e48-2951-4899-a854-104c84e295b2","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"重さは選べるんで割と入りやすいとは思います。最初は運動神経がその運動覚えてないから持てないだけですぐ倍の重さくらい持てるようになりますね。","ts":"1620656956.333200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xiGBg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fd8aab1-7e1d-4d58-931f-f8d989c4b93e","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"昔から苦手だ筋トレ","ts":"1620656863.331500","edited":{"user":"UGXMRNBUM","ts":"1620656868.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sk=cy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51dc1b65-a581-4476-bd3a-4c576bbba427","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"本気でヤラんとだめだな…","ts":"1620656849.331300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zq/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c62ca2c-30d8-4d37-8653-d2902c56f092","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u0026gt;  筋トレは２ヶ月もすれば明らかに体つきが変わる\n私のリングフィットは筋トレじゃないことがわかってきた","ts":"1620656671.330700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UGXMRNBUM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QrY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89390c0c-a65a-43ee-ab1b-a192f23f9e4a","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私は筋トレ派でしたね。筋トレは２ヶ月もすれば明らかに体つきが変わるので、あとは作ったプロダクトが陳腐化しないようにメンテしてしまうエンジニアの性質を利用すれば割と楽にいけるイメージありますね。","ts":"1620656308.330300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TM5q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff81f32c-da14-4dd0-87fd-dd228aafbb27","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"それほどストイックになれない。","ts":"1620656168.329000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5RP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49603ec9-cf17-46de-92d7-4510990b3507","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"僕は逆に筋トレ続く自信ないなぁ。","ts":"1620656111.328800","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1620656126.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aOb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92ad6725-7168-4ea8-aec7-9718d8839dfd","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ランニングは続けられるかどうかかなり適正ありますよね。私は過去５回は挑戦してますけどだめでしたね(2-3日に一回走るので最長3ヶ月。膝が痛くなって断念してそのまま自然消滅)。\n私はまだ筋トレの方がマシでした。","ts":"1620655673.328700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eLxo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da663c39-b466-4cca-88b2-cc599bc0e94f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ちなみに、もちろん走ってる時はキツいっすよw","ts":"1620655581.327400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ayashii","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pm5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f737f24c-d199-4502-b855-5b3e3a76ecef","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"小中高とサッカー部たったけど、こんなに自分が個人競技にハマると思ってなかった。","ts":"1620655356.326700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"16X5v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c1fe858-6c9e-433e-9b45-793084bd83d2","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私も最初は体重落としたいと思って筋トレ始めた気がするけど、もう何のためにやってるかもわからなくなりましたね・・・\n気持ちいいって感覚はまったくないですね・・・毎日嫌で嫌で仕方ない","ts":"1620655303.326500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["U03C6TEAZ","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rY+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f93c05e7-13e8-4f44-a1e7-b057e231aec0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"僕のケースはもう体重を落としたいニーズよりは、気持ちいいから走ってる方が強くなってしまった。","ts":"1620655120.324400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UL/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f56dd9e-b4f1-4d35-8af8-0f8645946269","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"こんなニュース見つけたのではっときます","ts":"1620644173.324100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FUc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26ab9195-907f-4d50-9c1d-ec22858fa86d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://www.businessinsider.jp/post-233974|https://www.businessinsider.jp/post-233974\u003e","ts":"1620644161.323900","attachments":[{"fallback":"運動では消費カロリーは増えない…健康のためには必要だが、長期的な体重管理には食事の方が重要","id":1,"title":"運動では消費カロリーは増えない…健康のためには必要だが、長期的な体重管理には食事の方が重要","title_link":"https://www.businessinsider.jp/post-233974","text":"運動は、特に長期的に見ると、脂肪の燃焼には効果的ではないかもしれないと最近の研究結果が示唆している。運動でカロリーを消費するとき、代謝システムが他の体内活動を抑制することでカロリー消費の帳尻を合わしている可能性がある。運動が体重を落とすに","image_url":"https://assets.media-platform.com/bi/dist/images/2021/04/28/5fbd2c0a32f2170011f70e1b-w960.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1620610200,"service_name":"businessinsider.jp","service_icon":"https://www.businessinsider.jp/asset/favicon/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://www.businessinsider.jp/post-233974","original_url":"https://www.businessinsider.jp/post-233974"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZB/V"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003c@U7JL1UKKL\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1620644152.323700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"35