c447-4561-969a-6379d11174ef","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"プロダクションがバグったときのあの思考スピードで仕事したらだいぶ捗る気がする","ts":"1620635738.318200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k6G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c5d55a3-e9ea-482b-89b8-2983fe1011db","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"超集中スイッチ欲しい","ts":"1620635684.317600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"unyl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3557113-fd11-4a03-8eb3-e3eafce4e3c2","type":"message","user":"UK0JC4CM8","text":"自分空腹だとお腹に気を取られて全然集中できないんですよね\n常に何か口に入れてる　ガムしかり飴しかり飲み物しかり","ts":"1620635566.317000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NLN"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UD6US3V24","text":"\u003c@UD6US3V24\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1620635027.315900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"91d4ee5e-b8cc-45d1-a491-56d7e8f255c9","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"リーンゲインズと運動を半年くらいやって、今のところ適正体重から動かなくなったので、地味に効果はあるのかな～と思って（信じて）ます。","ts":"1620634967.315700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6fwsx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20e64db4-e6e8-4213-98a3-d9274d28cb74","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"運動と組み合わせないと効果ないなーと思っています。","ts":"1620634921.314700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TuK/F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd429efe-04a0-464d-8458-54379381dea9","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"リーゲインズ法は、あくまでもオートファジーを起して脂肪燃焼しやすい状態にしたり、腸内の炎症レベル低下などを目的としたものなので、それだけで痩せるものではないです","ts":"1620634882.314400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7HR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e952edc9-c24f-412f-b0d7-739c8dd2f842","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"続き\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C016J5KFARM/p1620634794388800\u003e","ts":"1620634816.312900","attachments":[{"fallback":"[May 10th, 2021 1:19 AM] yutakatay: ちなみに私はリーンゲインズ２ヶ月目くらいですけど、別に痩せてないですねw\nまあ面白いから続けてるだけで特になにか効果感じてるわけではない","id":1,"author_id":"U7B4ZD49X","author_name":"yutkat","author_subname":"yutkat","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U7B4ZD49X","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2020-04-14/1081287266064_cb2d6ab85d9530d8a126_48.png","text":"ちなみに私はリーンゲインズ２ヶ月目くらいですけど、別に痩せてないですねw\nまあ面白いから続けてるだけで特になにか効果感じてるわけではない","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #hobby-gadget","ts":1620634794.388800,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C016J5KFARM/p1620634794388800","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C016J5KFARM/p1620634794388800"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fjr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb26ac3e-2bf6-4a1d-9c9a-c88058f505a7","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ジムとかにときどき置いてる筋肉量まで測れるやつ（よくあるのがインボディとか）も面白いですね。左右のバランスとか肉体年齢とかわかって。","ts":"1620633417.312700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B14o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47d4eacd-85b1-4e39-9ca4-23916a36902b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"はじめはHIIT結構きついのでHIITがきつければ\nSITをおすすめしておきます","ts":"1620618348.310800","thread_ts":"1620552541.297200","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IiB0"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"b6484846-a743-4c92-aa40-cbe83d902049","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"いいですよね。やり始めは運動会終わった後みたいなキツさでしたけどw\n去年の健康診断で脂肪肝って言われて、HIIT がいいらしく はじめましたw\n\u003chttps://oceans.tokyo.jp/lifestyle/2019-0914-4/?p_page=4\u003e","ts":"1620552541.297200","thread_ts":"1620552541.297200","attachments":[{"fallback":"血糖値も肝機能も改善する！ 1日｢たった4分｣の運動で身体能力が若返るワケ｜OCEANS オーシャンズウェブ","id":1,"title":"血糖値も肝機能も改善する！ 1日｢たった4分｣の運動で身体能力が若返るワケ｜OCEANS オーシャンズウェブ","title_link":"https://oceans.tokyo.jp/lifestyle/2019-0914-4/?p_page=4","text":"年を取るにつれて、体力の衰えや認知機能の低下など健康面での心配が増えていきます。しかし、本格的な運動や脳のトレーニングとなるとなかなか実行できないという人は多いかもしれません。そんな人々のために医師であり科学者でもある川田浩志氏が勧めるのが、HIITという最新トレーニングです。","image_url":"https://oceans.tokyo.jp/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/img_e757b654ceb68978fe5c6d2c0f9fe56f108978.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"oceans.tokyo.jp","service_icon":"https://oceans.tokyo.jp/wp-content/themes/oceans/dist/assets/images/apple-touch-icon-180x180.png","from_url":"https://oceans.tokyo.jp/lifestyle/2019-0914-4/?p_page=4","original_url":"https://oceans.tokyo.jp/lifestyle/2019-0914-4/?p_page=4"}],"edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1620553130.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3M1tn"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"de060538-1ee6-49ea-a434-37e7ba42c73c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"自分も計測手段がない","ts":"1620617841.310700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AJ3pm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4800e222-1ca5-4dab-95e3-3ab3ad7db64d","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"日によって18％くらいの時もある（体組成計が安物）","ts":"1620600083.309700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RwK9d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ee6367d-1f57-44c4-8e8f-46320dd2ac7e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"計測する手段がないけど20%くらいはありそうかなあ...","ts":"1620600075.309500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e774"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a74a0c70-c103-4515-b4ed-405070009b34","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"あ、僕は16%でした","ts":"1620599817.308800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_tex